Client OAUTH callback / token refresh not implemented / incompatible with librdkafka expectations

Confluent Python uses librdkafka’s OAuth support which may require a oauthbearer_token_refresh_cb style callback or config. If your code supplies a token but doesn't hook the refresh or callback correctly, the handshake stalls / times out. Community issues mention token refresh bugs. 
