librdkafka / confluent-kafka version bug or missing feature

Older librdkafka versions had subtle timeouts or OAuth bugs. Ensure you're on a modern librdkafka + confluent-kafka build. GH issues historically show _MSG_TIMED_OUT linked to client-side issues. 
